// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
// Wallet authentication service (ADR-020). Citizens log in with OIDC and
// PKCE at a national IdP. The service issues short lived session JWTs and
// holds no personal data beyond the pairwise subject iss|sub.
// The OIDC provider redirects the browser to GET /wallet/auth/callback,
// a plain HTTP handler that calls LoginCallback (ADR-003 decision 7).
// The JWKS at GET /.well-known/jwks.json is also plain HTTP.

